            <h2>Want us to run the outreach?</h2>
            <p>We build the shortlist by tier, pair every claim with a credentialed reviewer, write the pitches responsibly and place them on real health publications. No link farms, no risk.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: 0;">
